linked-accounts-renew-other-name = Sign in with a different name
linked-accounts-renew-unreachable = The mailbox’s server could not be reached, so the password was not checked. Try again later.
linked-accounts-renew-limit = Too many attempts to renew this mailbox. Wait a few minutes and try again.
linked-accounts-renew-credential-rejected = The mailbox’s server no longer accepts the saved password. It may have been changed.
linked-accounts-renew-factor = This mailbox uses two-step verification, so its access cannot renew by itself. Renew it here when it ends.
linked-accounts-renew-zero-access = Zero-access mode is on, so the server does not keep this mailbox’s password. Renew access here when it ends.
linked-accounts-renew-policy = Your administrator does not allow saved mailbox passwords, so renew access here when it ends.
linked-accounts-renew-unsupported = This kind of mailbox cannot renew its access by itself. Renew it here when it ends.
linked-accounts-store-help = The mailbox password is kept encrypted on this server, so access renews by itself and survives restarts. It is never shown again or sent to your browser. Mailboxes with two-step verification are renewed by signing in again when access ends.
linked-accounts-store-zero-access = Zero-access mode is on, so this server will not keep the mailbox password. Renew access when it ends.
linked-accounts-store-policy = Your administrator does not allow saved mailbox passwords. Renew access when it ends.
